WEBVTT

00:04:58.823 --> 00:05:00.018
lowest to highest.

00:05:00.042 --> 00:05:03.152
And you can see
that the signature of a stream

00:05:03.176 --> 00:05:07.957
is represented here in the bottom
third or half of the page,

00:05:07.981 --> 00:05:11.400
while birds that were once in that meadow

00:05:11.424 --> 00:05:14.457
are represented in the signature
across the top.

00:05:14.481 --> 00:05:15.612
There were a lot of them.

00:05:15.636 --> 00:05:18.776
And here's Lincoln Meadow
before selective logging.

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:33.569
(Nature sounds)